From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 01:52:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3576/3799] soh: rename func_80B4FFF0 -> EnZl2_SpawnCrystalWarp

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: spawns the WARP_PURPLE_CRYSTAL door as Zelda's child, once
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
index b28158ae3..11c31778f 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
@@ -710,7 +710,8 @@ void EnZl2_SpawnYellowWarp(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B4FFF0(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B4FFF0: spawns the WARP_PURPLE_CRYSTAL door as Zelda's child, once
+void EnZl2_SpawnCrystalWarp(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     f32 posX;
     f32 posY;
     f32 posZ;
@@ -922,7 +923,7 @@ void EnZl2_SetupAction16(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->action = 16;
     this->drawConfig = 1;
     this->actor.shape.shadowAlpha = 0xFF;
-    func_80B4FFF0(this, play);
+    EnZl2_SpawnCrystalWarp(this, play);  // was func_80B4FFF0 [LLM:HIGH]
     EnZl2_setEyesIndex(this, 3);
 }
 
